---
description: Standing rules for CareCircle
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Run backend tests with `python -m pytest backend/tests -q`; frontend checks with `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` from `frontend/`. Start with `docker compose up --build -d`.

Single-port LAN deployment on 8000; README is cumulative; backend owns deterministic decisions; operational, not clinical; synthetic data only; authorize every endpoint; no secrets/CDNs; work on main; implement only current phase; offline LAN use. Every feature must reduce caregiver coordination burden, improve explainable coverage, or support resource planning. Prefer one-tap decisions and management-by-exception over more notifications.
